$bog_figmol_app_mates $mol_view
	live $bog_figmol_live
	sub <= chips /$mol_view
	- \Name this browser goes by. Sits among the others rather than in a settings
	- \panel: it is only worth saying when there is somebody to say it to.
	Name $mol_string
		value? <=> name? \
		hint <= name_hint @ \You
	Chip* $mol_view
		sub /
			<= Dot* $mol_view
				style *
					backgroundColor <= chip_color* \
			<= chip_name* \
